    "result_text": "The implementation is complete and the full test suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `ageBand` derivation for `POST /api/owners` (read back via `GET /api/owners/{id}`). When a request includes `birthDate` (ISO), the owner's `ageBand` is returned as `MINOR` (under 18), `ADULT` (18\u201364) or `SENIOR` (65+), computed against `registrationDate`.\n\nChanges:\n\n1. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added `birthDate` (input, `date`) to the `OwnerFields` schema and `ageBand` (read-only string) to the `Owner` response schema. The DTOs are regenerated from this at build time.\n\n2. **`model/Owner.java`** \u2014 Added a persisted `birthDate` (`LocalDate`, column `birth_date`) with getter/setter, so the value survives to `GET` time where `ageBand` is derived.\n\n3. **Schemas** \u2014 Added a `birth_date DATE` column to the `owners` table in all four `schema.sql` files (hsqldb/h2/mysql/postgres), and one matching trailing `NULL` to the positional seed inserts in `hsqldb/data.sql` (the only one using positional `VALUES`; h2/postgres use named-column inserts).\n\n4. **`mapper/AgeBand.java`** \u2014 New standalone helper (matching the `MembershipLevel`/`Locality` pattern) computing completed-years age via `Period.between(birthDate, registrationDate)` \u2192 band, returning `null` when no `birthDate` was supplied.\n\n5. **`mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Wired `ageBand` via a MapStruct expression calling `AgeBand.of(...)`. `birthDate` maps automatically by name from `OwnerFieldsDto` \u2192 `Owner` in the existing `BuildOwner` step.\n\nHow it flows through the OfficeFloor pipeline: `RequireOwnerFields` binds the body (now carrying `birthDate`), `BuildOwner` maps it onto the entity, `SaveOwner` persists it, and `RespondWithOwner`/`RespondWithOwnerCreated` run it through `OwnerMapper` which derives `ageBand`. No new function classes or YAML were needed since it's a derived response field on an existing entity.\n\nThe acceptance test `coreDerivesAgeBand` (birthDate `1990-01-01` \u2192 `ADULT`) and the full suite pass: **BUILD SUCCESS**.",
